hadiths[20]{hadithnumber,text}:
"444","Abu'l-'Ubaydayn said"
"445","Ibn 'Abbas said that he said that """"the squanderers"""" were those\nwho wasted money incorrectly."""""
"446","Zayd ibn Aslam reported from his father that 'Umar used to say\non the minbar"
"447","Khabbab said"
"448","'Abdullah ibn 'Amr was heard to say to a nephew of his who had\nleft al-Waht"
"449","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"450","Al-Hasan said"
"451","Dawud ibn Qays said"
"452","""Do not make your buildings tall. That will come about in\nthe worst of your days.""""'"""""""""
"453","It is reported that Habba ibn Khalid and Sawa' ibn Khalid came\nto the Prophet"
"454","Qays ibn Abi Hazm said"
"455","He continued"
"456","'Abdullah ibn 'Amr said"
"457","Nafi' ibn al-Harith reported that the Prophet"
"458","Thabit reported that he was with Anas in a corner above one of\nhis rooms. He said"
"459","meaning striped clothes."""""
"460","Warrad"
"461","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"462","'A'isha"
"463","Jarir ibn 'Abdullah reported that the Messenger of Allah"
